WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
Benchmarks span three families: dynamical graph
systems like Edit Cycles,

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.665
Degree Rules and Game of Life;

00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:12.231
tree systems for Boolean-formula simplification and
Peano addition; and, for scaling,

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:17.993
an arXiv citation network of about twenty-seven
thousand papers yielding fifteen hundred

00:00:18.073 --> 00:00:20.940
sub-graphs up to nearly three thousand nodes.
